.TH MARBOR\-KEY 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-key \- per\-API-key local/cloud routing overrides (masked list, plaintext\-once on create)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor key
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
per\-API-key local/cloud routing overrides (masked list, plaintext\-once on create)
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list keys (masked)
.TP
.B create
create a key (prints plaintext once)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-name string
key name (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-rate-limit int
max requests per hour (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-daily-limit int
max requests per day (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-monthly-limit int
max requests per month (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-daily-usd-cap string
daily cloud spend cap in USD (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-monthly-usd-cap string
monthly cloud spend cap in USD (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-models string
comma\-separated allowed models (empty = all)
.TP
.B \-\-expires-at string
expiry date (2006-01-02 or RFC3339)
.TP
.B \-\-key string
explicit secret (default: server\-generated)
.TP
.B \-\-local-only string
block cloud fallback: true or false
.TP
.B \-\-allow-local-degradation string
allow local alternate model: true or false
.RE
.TP
.B revoke <name>
revoke (delete) a key
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-yes
confirm revocation without prompting
.RE
.TP
.B patch <name>
update key settings
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-rate-limit string
max requests per hour (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-daily-limit string
max requests per day (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-monthly-limit string
max requests per month (0 = unlimited)
.TP
.B \-\-daily-usd-cap string
daily cloud spend cap in USD
.TP
.B \-\-monthly-usd-cap string
monthly cloud spend cap in USD
.TP
.B \-\-models string
comma\-separated allowed models (empty = clear)
.TP
.B \-\-expires-at string
expiry date (2006-01-02 or RFC3339, empty = clear)
.TP
.B \-\-local-only string
block cloud fallback: true or false
.TP
.B \-\-allow-local-degradation string
allow local alternate model: true or false
.RE
.TP
.B set\-local-only <name> <true|false>
block (or re\-allow) cloud fallback for one API key
.TP
.B set\-allow-local-degradation <name> <true|false>
let (or forbid) one API key receive a local alternate model
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
